OL,3,AWhat to do if you missed out on
OL,4,AGlastonbury tickets
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of people were left
OL,7,Fdisappointed on Sunday after tickets
OL,8,Ffor Glastonbury Festival sold out in 42
OL,9,Fminutes.
OL,11,FOrganisers used a new booking system
OL,12,Ffor the first time which entered people
OL,13,Finto a virtual waiting room. Despite
OL,14,Fhaving capacity for 210,000 people,
OL,15,Fdemand is always much higher than
OL,16,Fsupply.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
