OL,3,AWhat to do if you missed out on
OL,4,AGlastonbury tickets
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut those who missed out on Sunday
OL,7,Fshould not lose hope, as there are
OL,8,Fother ways to secure a ticket for the
OL,9,Fworld-famous event when it returns to
OL,10,FWorthy Farm in Somerset from 23-27
OL,11,FJune.
OL,13,FBelow is everything you need to know
OL,14,Fabout how you can still secure a pass
OL,15,Ffor the 2027 festival.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
